WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.151
My plan was to invent a relaxing bubble bath soap that would help Molly sleep.

2
00:00:07.152 --> 00:00:11.200
Inventors call that "formulating."

3
00:00:11.201 --> 00:00:16.221
I had decided to formulate a special soap just for Molly.

4
00:00:16.222 --> 00:00:20.554
I couldn't wait to get started!

5
00:00:20.555 --> 00:00:26.129
When we got home, Molly asked her babysitter if she could go to my apartment.

6
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:32.172
"Okay," said Lucy, who was watching TV with Caswell in the living room.

7
00:00:32.173 --> 00:00:38.024
"You're missing a great episode of Monster Madness !" Caswell told

8
00:00:38.025 --> 00:00:48.302
Molly. Sure enough, I could hear the roars of monsters and the screams of frightened people coming from the

9
00:00:48.303 --> 00:00:52.407
TV. "Let's get out of here," Molly whispered to

10
00:00:52.408 --> 00:00:56.844
me. A few minutes later, Molly and I were sitting at my kitchen

11
00:00:56.845 --> 00:01:01.733
table. Molly looked a little better, but she still seemed pretty

12
00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:06.451
upset. "I'm going to formulate a very special invention," I told

13
00:01:06.452 --> 00:01:09.959
her. "It will help you relax so you can sleep

14
00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:15.284
better." "I hope it works," said Molly with a

15
00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:22.008
sigh. "As soon as I close my eyes at night, a scary monster appears in my

16
00:01:22.009 --> 00:01:26.053
mind!" "Don't worry," I said. "My invention will fix

17
00:01:26.054 --> 00:01:29.235
that. What's your favorite food in the whole

18
00:01:29.236 --> 00:01:31.231
world?" Molly's face

19
00:01:31.232 --> 00:01:36.770
brightened. "Cherries!" she said. "I love

20
00:01:36.771 --> 00:01:45.156
cherries!" "Okay." I went to the cupboard and rummaged around until I found a bottle of cherry

21
00:01:45.157 --> 00:01:48.104
juice. Molly was watching me with

22
00:01:48.105 --> 00:01:52.466
curiosity. "Are you going to make me something to drink?" she

23
00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:57.768
asked. "I'm going to make something even better than that!" I

24
00:01:57.769 --> 00:02:04.737
promised. I got an empty jar and filled it up with soapy

25
00:02:04.738 --> 00:02:08.835
water. Then I poured lots of cherry juice into the

26
00:02:08.836 --> 00:02:12.278
jar. I shook up the mixture until it was all

27
00:02:12.279 --> 00:02:16.047
foamy. At last I handed it to

28
00:02:16.048 --> 00:02:18.191
Molly. "Here you go!" I

29
00:02:18.192 --> 00:02:23.276
said. "Your very own mixture of Enchanting Cherry bath soap.

30
00:02:23.277 --> 00:02:26.570
Pour it into the tub before you take a bath tonight.

31
00:02:26.571 --> 00:02:30.392
It will totally relax you before bedtime!"

32
00:02:30.393 --> 00:02:33.738
"Iggy!" yelled Tate from his room.

33
00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:36.971
"Get in here and get your stuff!"

34
00:02:36.972 --> 00:02:43.918
Boy, I couldn't wait until I formulated special bubble bath soaps so Tate could relax.

35
00:02:43.919 --> 00:02:47.168
But his favorite food is granola bars.

36
00:02:47.169 --> 00:02:51.825
Who wants to take a granola bar bath?

37
00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:56.830
I thought about Molly's Enchanting Cherry bubble bath all through dinner.

38
00:02:56.831 --> 00:03:01.749
I couldn't wait to hear about how my invention had helped her.

39
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:07.837
I had just finished getting my stuff out of Tate's closet when the doorbell rang.

40
00:03:07.838 --> 00:03:11.323
"It's for you, Piggy!" Tate called.

41
00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:15.683
Sometimes my brother calls me "Piggy" instead of "Iggy."

42
00:03:15.684 --> 00:03:18.095
He does it just to get me mad.

43
00:03:18.096 --> 00:03:20.811
I didn't get mad this time though.

44
00:03:20.812 --> 00:03:26.465
After all, I'm the guy who invents things to calm people down, right?

45
00:03:26.466 --> 00:03:29.369
I went to the door.

46
00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:33.807
Molly was standing there in her bathrobe and slippers.

47
00:03:33.808 --> 00:03:37.077
"Iggy," she said, glaring at me.

48
00:03:37.078 --> 00:03:41.315
"I tried taking an Enchanting Cherry bubble bath!"

49
00:03:41.316 --> 00:03:44.578
"What's the matter?" I asked.

50
00:03:44.579 --> 00:03:50.831
"It was really sticky!" Molly cried. "And itchy!"

51
00:03:50.832 --> 00:03:55.704
"Uh-oh," I thought, watching her scratch her arms.

52
00:03:55.705 --> 00:04:01.865
I didn't want to say anything, but her skin looked a little red—as in cherry red.

53
00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:06.947
My brilliant invention had obviously backfired.

54
00:04:06.948 --> 00:04:10.951
Suddenly Molly gave me a pleading look.

55
00:04:10.952 --> 00:04:13.108
"You have to help me, Iggy.

56
00:04:13.109 --> 00:04:17.233
I don't want to think about monsters again tonight!"

57
00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:18.962
My heart sunk.

58
00:04:18.963 --> 00:04:23.275
I needed a new idea, and I needed it fast.

59
00:04:23.276 --> 00:04:26.955
Or poor Molly would never get any sleep.

60
00:04:26.956 --> 00:04:28.410
I could do it.

61
00:04:28.411 --> 00:04:29.691
I knew I could.

62
00:04:29.692 --> 00:04:39.526
After all, I was Iggy the incredible inventor, and my best friend was depending on me.

